zfls is a native port of [fortls](https://github.com/fortran-lang/fortls), the Python Fortran language server. It speaks the same Language Server Protocol subset, with the same command line options and configuration files.

It then goes further: an outline tree, folding, semantic highlighting, code lenses, call and type hierarchies, inlay hints, code actions, formatting, and include directories and preprocessor definitions read from the project's build files.
